# 224XL v8.21: boots to CONCERT HALL B1 P1 V1 on the LARC by ~30M cycles.
# Input pulse, then all six LARC faders (the XL compiles each move into WCS
# writes), then more pulses while the new settings run.
30500000 audio 512 0 0 0
